00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.910
Collaborative robots and
more accessible automation

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.130
will complement
local physical labor

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.300
and increase productivity
where needed.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.155
This is how automation and AI
can enhance human skills right

00:18:32.155 --> 00:18:35.090
here in local labor markets.

